{
  "id": "666",
  "title": "What’s Inside Your Bag?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-02-23",
  "synopsis": "Lili’s bag is very heavy, but what does she have inside it?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/973/e50978ef9133f7054bfdcf17f3b62dadbdadee60.mp3?1698350099",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你的包里有什么？\n\n丽丽：好重啊！\n本：你的包里有什么？怎么那么重？\n丽丽：我的包里有手机、钱包、公车卡、餐巾纸、书、化妆品……啊，还有水。\n本：那么多东西！\n丽丽：这些都是每天都要用的东西呀。\n本：我只带手机。",
    "traditional": "你的包裡有什麼？\n\n麗麗：好重啊！\n本：你的包裡有什麼？怎麼那麼重？\n麗麗：我的包裡有手機、錢包、公車卡、餐巾紙、書、化妝品……啊，還有水。\n本：那麼多東西！\n麗麗：這些都是每天都要用的東西呀。\n本：我只帶手機。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What’s Inside Your Bag?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好重啊！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好重啊！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo zhòng a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: It’s so heavy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：你的包里有什么？怎么那么重？",
      "traditional": "本：你的包裡有什麼？怎麼那麼重？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ de bāo lǐ yǒu shén me zěn me nà me zhòng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What’s inside your bag? How come it’s so heavy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我的包里有手机、钱包、公车卡、餐巾纸、书、化妆品……啊，还有水。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我的包裡有手機、錢包、公車卡、餐巾紙、書、化妝品……啊，還有水。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ de bāo lǐ yǒu shǒu jī qián bāo gōng chē kǎ cān jīn zhǐ shū huà zhuāng pǐn a hái yǒu shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: In my bag, I have my phone, wallet, bus card, paper napkins, books, cosmetics… Oh, and water as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：那么多东西！",
      "traditional": "本：那麼多東西！",
      "pinyin": "běn nà me duō dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: So much stuff!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：这些都是每天都要用的东西呀。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：這些都是每天都要用的東西呀。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhè xiē dōu shì měi tiān dōu yào yòng de dōng xi ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: These are all things that I use every day."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：我只带手机。",
      "traditional": "本：我只帶手機。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ zhǐ dài shǒu jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I only carry my phone."
    }
  ],
